<title>USA: TABLE-Amer Superconductor Q1 June 30 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Amer Superconductor Q1 June 30 net.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Superconductor Corporation</p>
<p>		 Earnings Report for First Quarter Fiscal 1998</p>
<p>					     Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>						     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Revenues				   $3,565,599     $2,855,823</p>
<p> Net loss				    2,712,993	3,444,924</p>
<p> Loss per share				   0.23	     0.33</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>						11,570,723     10,493,185</p>
<p>NOTE:  For the three months ended  June 30, 1997 in addition to reported revenues, American Superconductor recorded $449,869 in funding under government cost-sharing agreements, versus $70,562 in the previous year's period. Results for the fiscal 1997 period have been restated to reflect the April 8, 1997 acquisition of Superconductivity, Inc.</p>
</text>
